{"case_id": "2330-q-guidance-gross-margin", "mode": "investigation", "status": "Answered", "answer": "台積電 2026 年第二季毛利率指引區間為 **65.5% 至 67.5%**（基於 1 美元兌 31.7 新台幣的匯率假設）[1][2]。", "citations": [{"index": 1, "source_type": "LocalDocument", "document_type": "EarningsPresentation", "page": 9, "title": "2330 ca4e748c-2831-4e77-964e-ce660da68da9 233020260416E001.pdf", "quote": "Company: 台積電\nTicker: 2330\nExchange: TWSE\nDocumentType: EarningsPresentation\nSource: InvestorConference\nConferenceDate: unknown\nLanguage: en\nPage: 9\n\nUnleashInnovation©82026TSMC, LtdTSMC Property2Q26 GuidanceBased on our current business outlook, management expects:▪Revenue to be between US$39.0billion and US$40.2billionAnd, based on the exchange rate assumption of 1 US dollar to 31.7 NT dollars, management expects:▪Gross profit margin to be between 65.5% and 67.5%▪Operating profit margin to be between 56.5% and 58.5%", "url": null}, {"index": 2, "source_type": "LocalDocument", "document_type": "EarningsPresentation", "page": 9, "title": "2330 ca4e748c-2831-4e77-964e-ce660da68da9 233020260416M001.pdf", "quote": "Company: 台積電\nTicker: 2330\nExchange: TWSE\nDocumentType: EarningsPresentation\nSource: InvestorConference\nConferenceDate: unknown\nLanguage: zh-TW\nPage: 9\n\nUnleashInnovation©82026TSMC, LtdTSMC Property2026年第二季業績展望基於目前對營運展望的假設，台積公司預期：•合併營收約介於美金390億元到402億元之間。此外，基於平均匯率31.7的假設，台積公司預期：•營業毛利率約介於百分之65.5到百分之67.5之間。•營業利益率約介於百分之56.5到百分之58.5之間。", "url": null}], "candidates": [{"document_type": "EarningsPresentation", "page": 4, "title": "2330 ca4e748c-2831-4e77-964e-ce660da68da9 233020260416M001.pdf", "rank": 5, "selected": false}, {"document_type": "EarningsPresentation", "page": 10, "title": "2330 ca4e748c-2831-4e77-964e-ce660da68da9 233020260416E001.pdf", "rank": 2, "selected": false}, {"document_type": "EarningsPresentation", "page": 9, "title": "2330 ca4e748c-2831-4e77-964e-ce660da68da9 233020260416M001.pdf", "rank": 6, "selected": true}, {"document_type": "EarningsPresentation", "page":